# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
This document outlines revisions to our sustainable fashion research plan, focusing on reducing waste and promoting eco-friendly practices. We aim to collaborate with environmental organizations and influencers in the fashion industry to enhance our approach.<br>
<br>
### Potential Collaborations<br>
* Partner with organizations like the Ellen MacArthur Foundation to develop circular economy strategies.<br>
* Collaborate with social media influencers to promote sustainable fashion choices.<br>
* Work with textile manufacturers to implement environmentally friendly production methods.<br>
<br>
## Research Plan Revisions<br>
<br>
